The Hivemother was an insectoid creature some eighty feet long, coiled around the central pillar of a cathedral room in the forsaken sector of [[Geography/Istria/Iomenei/index|Iomenei]]. It bred the [[Bestiary/Swarm Child|swarm children]], emitting them as it was watched, and a horn grew from its mouth. Its brood claimed the room around it. It was a different kind of bug from the swarm children.

It is dead, killed by [[People/Barlow Crane|Barlow Crane]], [[People/Grant FireEye|Grant FireEye]], [[People/Gage|Gage]] and [[Org/Velvet Mark/People/Archie|Archie]]. Every other insect in the room collapsed where it stood when it was split in two. The saboteur [[People/Gerhard|Gerhard]] was not in its room, and more of the insects may have taken root elsewhere in the city.
